  "description": "Test build of Yorick as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Yorick so Last Rites digs a grave for every minion or monster it kills (the main pack: every second blow on anything but a champion), and the Maiden of the Mist's bonus damage hits only the champion she follows (the main pack: any champion while she stands). 0.2.0: the Mist Walkers and the Maiden are units of their own through the mod API's spawn_unit - the Awakening raises three walkers round its target that walk, bite (9 + 13% of his attack) and can be killed (10 s), Mourning Mist makes them leap to the champion it strikes, and R raises the Maiden (15 s, 20 + 45% a claw) with two walkers (the main pack's are pictures and bites riding on the target); a host that gives no unit keeps the riding ones. Needs the main pack's sheets league/champions/league_yorick_walker and league_yorick_maiden. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-14",
  "mod_id": "league_yorick",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Yorick's graves, the Maiden's target and his walkers and Maiden as units (test)",
  "version": "0.2.1"
}
